<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Uncle Mark's Tutorials - 6 - Toledo Hits 'Em Hard, 2004</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;This scenario assumes that Al-Queada camps have been discovered in northern Pakistan.&amp;nbsp; It also assumes Pakistan&amp;nbsp;has been&amp;nbsp;unwilling to allow the United States to strike directly at these terrorists, on the grounds that camps found within their sovereign territory are under their jurisdiction.&amp;nbsp; (In fairness, this is not a&amp;nbsp;completely unreasonable&amp;nbsp;argument--imagine how America would respond if even an ally like France or Japan suddenly annonced they had found terrorists in Maine or New Jersey and that they wanted to hit residential areas with&amp;nbsp;laser-guided bombs.)&amp;nbsp; However, in this case,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;HUMINT sources indicate that&amp;nbsp;elements within the Pakistani military are sympathetic to Al-Queada and are trying to shield the terrorists.&amp;nbsp; Washington intends to take action.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;Pakistan has warned the United States that it will not tolerate direct military action against targets within its territory.&amp;nbsp; The President, however, has no intention of allowing the terrorists to escape justice.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
